面文字，回答问题。</span></p><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid #555;padding:6px;vertical-align:top\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">[</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">甲</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">]</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">九日</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;font-size:12.0pt\"><sup>①</sup></span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">文森</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">三载重阳菊，开时不在家。</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">何期今日酒，忽对故园花。</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">野旷云连树，天寒雁聚沙。</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">登临无限意，何处望京华。</span></p></td><td style=\"border:1px solid #555;padding:6px;vertical-align:top\"><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">[</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">乙</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">]</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">九日卫使君</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;font-size:12.0pt\"><sup>②</sup></span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">筵上作</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">武瓘</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">佳晨登赏喜还乡，谢宇</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;font-size:12.0pt\"><sup>③</sup></span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">开筵晚兴长。</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">满眼黄花初泛酒，隔烟红树欲迎霜。</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">千家门户笙歌发，十里江山白鸟翔。</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">共贺安人丰乐岁，幸陪珠履</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;font-size:12.0pt\"><sup>④</sup></span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">侍银章</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;font-size:12.0pt\"><sup>⑤</sup></span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">。</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">注：</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;font-size:10.5pt\">①</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">（九日）农历九月初九，即重阳节。</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;font-size:10.5pt\">②</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">（卫使君）池州刺史。</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;font-size:10.5pt\">③</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">（谢宇）这里指刺史的宅子。</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;font-size:10.5pt\">④</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">（珠履）以珠为饰的鞋，这里指幕僚。</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri;font-size:10.5pt\">⑤</span><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">（银章）银质的印章，这里指刺史。</span></p>","parts":[{"key":"01","section":null,"header":"","ids":["SJZ-7AFFB3D60F13#01"]},{"key":"02","section":null,"header":"","ids":["SJZ-7AFFB3D60F13#02"]},{"key":"03","section":null,"header":"","ids":["SJZ-7AFFB3D60F13#03"]}],"sections":[]},"searchText":"4．（5分）阅读下面文字，回答问题。[甲]九日①文森三载重阳菊，开时不在家。何期今日酒，忽对故园花。野旷云连树，天寒雁聚沙。登临无限意，何处望京华。[乙]九日卫使君②筵上作武瓘佳晨登赏喜还乡，谢宇③开筵晚兴长。满眼黄花初泛酒，隔烟红树欲迎霜。千家门户笙歌发，十里江山白鸟翔。共贺安人丰乐岁，幸陪珠履④侍银章⑤。注：①（九日）农历九月初九，即重阳节。②（卫使君）池州刺史。③（谢宇）这里指刺史的宅子。④（珠履）以珠为饰的鞋，这里指幕僚。⑤（银章）银质的印章，这里指刺史。\n（1）根据相关诗句，推断甲诗中的“故园花”指什么花。\n（2）乙诗的颈联描绘了一幅什么样的画面？\n（3）同为重阳诗作，两首诗分别表达了诗人怎样的情感？","sourceVersionRef":"5deee4a5ddf54cc45b7a","contentHistory":[{"ref":"33dcdac57978d86439c1","date":"2026-10-30","reason":"本批提取/来源定位版本"},{"ref":"d46601122c1f4ec6a302","date":"2026-10-30","reason":"本批提取/来源定位版本"}],"qualityAudit":{"previousAnswerStatus":"所供解析答案已逐问挂接（非官方终审）"}},"questions":{"SJZ-7AFFB3D60F13#01":{"summary":"（1）根据相关诗句，推断甲诗中的“故园花”指什么花。","sourceExcerpt":"（1）根据相关诗句，推断甲诗中的“故园花”指什么花。","reason":"原二级“诗句信息定位”归并为新二级“诗句信息定位”","block":29,"locator":"原卷OOXML精确文本区间","matchScore":1,"raw":{"候选ID":"中考|ZK2025|古诗词鉴赏|text-九日卫使君筵上作","原卷小问号":"4(1)","审核白名单":"4(1)；4(2)；4(3)","主考点":"内容理解","细分考点":"诗句信息定位","复合副考点":"","赏析角度":"","核验状态":"题型已确认","标签判定依据":"原二级“诗句信息定位”归并为新二级“诗句信息定位”","作答形式":"简答","答案状态":"来源解析已核对"},"studentHtml":"<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">（1）根据相关诗句，推断甲诗中的“故园花”指什么花。</span></p>","studentAnswerHtml":"<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><span style=\"font-family:新宋体;font-size:10.5pt\">（1）菊花（菊）</span></p>","answerEvidence":{"fileRef":"/bank/originals/D-daed1177b915fafc.docx","xmlBlocks":[220,223],"textRanges":[[0,9]],"sourceKind":"所供解析版，非官方评分标准"},"labelHistory":{"beforePoetry12":{"main":"内容理解","sub":"诗句信息定位","secondary":"","angle":"","status":"本批AI逐问初标，待抽查","reason":"按原卷任务复用现有V1.2题型标签","reviewRequired":true,"raw":{"候选ID":"中考|ZK2025|古诗词鉴赏|text-九日卫使君筵上作","原卷小问号":"4(1)","审核白名单":"4(1)；4(2)；4(3)"}},"poetry12WorkbookSha256":"6d657faa6d686ffd39d2852da75f55e477220e6b8336f41caea4c0d347e079ac"},"labelReview":{"status":"题型已确认","sourceStatus":"题型已确认","sourceWorkbookSha256":"6d657faa6d686ffd39d2852da75f55e477220e6b8336f41caea4c0d347e079ac","date":"2026-11-01","versionHash":"2050da8fec8eea2642a0ce9af66c376fc7e8fef376d3fb5e519446640c8dd204","method":"按教师指定简化回填表逐ID同步；原题核验与标签结论分别记录","isAliasMirror":false},"poetrySourceVerification":{"status":"已校正·可索引","sourceStatus":"已校正·可索引","wordId":"D-daed1177b915fafc","wordSha256":"daed1177b915fafc104f28f9818f56fd7987aa429f242a713e8